==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:\\
The UART is present as Pads marked J4 on the PCB, the sequence of the pads is: 3.3V - TX - RX - GND. 3.3V is the square pad.
In particular, the ground pad is difficult to solder because of a large ground plane acting as heat-sink.
Either use a powerful (>=100W) solder iron with a large tip or drill a 1-1.2mm hole into the lead-pad in order to through-connect a pin.

